### 5. Asset allocation and diversification

- Asset allocation: How you divide investments among stocks, bonds, cash, real estate, and other assets.
- Diversification: Spreading investments across different companies, industries, and asset types to reduce concentration risk.

Why it matters: If your business already depends on technology or engineering clients, you may not want your entire investment portfolio dependent on the same industry.

