### 8. Tax efficiency

Understanding how different income sources, investments, business structures, and retirement accounts are taxed.

Key terms include marginal tax rate, effective tax rate, capital gains, tax deductions, tax credits, and tax-advantaged accounts.

Why it matters: Growing wealth isn't just about making money. It's also about understanding how much you keep legally after taxes.

