### 9. Risk management and insurance

Insurance transfers certain financial risks to an insurer in exchange for premiums.

Key terms: term life insurance, disability insurance, health insurance, liability insurance, umbrella insurance, and business insurance.

Why it matters: If your family depends on your technical skills and income, protecting your ability to earn may be as important as choosing investments.

